  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the HTML UI browsing to an RDFSource object's versions (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/apple_box/carton_of_apples/fcr:versions)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/apple_box/carton_of_apples/fcr:versions)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " results in being redirected to non-existant fcr:metadata (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/apple_box/carton_of_apples/fcr:versions/fcr:metadata)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/apple_box/carton_of_apples/fcr:versions/fcr:metadata)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " because the original URI does not return a Link Header (which is how we determine a RDFSource).",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/resources/views/common.js#L96"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/resources/views/common.js#L96",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Possibly twitchy solution is to not redirect if the URI ends in \"/fcr:*\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
